下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3feb77dcc207d59c1b1916d104ddbffc37962eea2dd02cbfc1fccdecf537fc52.png","width":371,"height":282,"width_mm":47.886,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q03-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第3题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. “笛音雷”在 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻上升至最高点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}\\sim t_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间内“笛音雷”做自由落体运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}\\sim t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间内“笛音雷”的平均速度小于 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{1}}{2}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}\\sim t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间内“笛音雷”先失重后超重"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q04","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"468140c12cdc99ffa6d372c98eba3c10dcf210ef4dd46e782a7de3170be802b6","body":[{"type":"text","value":"4. 今年暑假，“浙BA”篮球联赛燃爆全省，在某次比赛中，一队员罚球时投出的篮球因水平击中篮板而错失得分的机会。已知篮球出手点到地面的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 1.8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，击中的篮板上的点到地面的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"H = 3.05\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，出手点到篮筐的水平距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 4.8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，忽略篮球运动过程中所受的空气阻力，重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则出手时篮球的速度大小约为\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cc614db995c026f8876c326a0b7b538211fe771d3b06024448f87f43ed0c218a.png","width":387,"height":217,"width_mm":45.492,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q04-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第4题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"10.8\\mathrm{m / s}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"9.6\\mathrm{m / s}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"8.0\\mathrm{m / s}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"5.0\\mathrm{m / s}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q05","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q05","number":"5","order":5,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"64d6910d76a01010e6a1d39be6468c4d2504265d8088e38b48600d2105b7c79e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"5. 如图所示为一种称为“魔盘”的娱乐设施，当水平转盘绕竖直中心轴缓慢转动时，人会随着“魔盘”一起转动，当“魔盘”转动到一定速度时，人会“贴”在“魔盘”竖直壁上，而不会滑下。现质量均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的甲、乙两小孩参加该娱乐活动，初始时甲小孩位于距轴 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" 处，乙小孩贴紧“魔盘”侧壁。“魔盘”从静止开始缓慢加速转动，当达到角速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，“魔盘”突然停止转动，甲小孩滑至盘面上的某点停止。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/818a19cb7abd22c976dad44bd5aa8660575d15c2e1ba16fe8491d2e4f3dbb131.png","width":310,"height":263,"width_mm":36.433,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q05-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第5题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A.“魔盘”加速过程中，甲小孩所受摩擦力的冲量为零"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B.“魔盘”加速过程中，乙小孩所受摩擦力的方向指向转轴"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C.“魔盘”停止转动后，甲小孩沿转盘半径方向运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D.“魔盘”停止转动后，甲小孩克服摩擦力做的功为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} m\\omega^2 r^2"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q06","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q06","number":"6","order":6,"type":"单选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"be23b5ddd13b04404fccfaf30f205f872770600bda2883ab64a29c2d5051ae91","body":[{"type":"text","value":"6. 镀有反射膜的三棱镜常用在激光器中用来选择波长。如图，一束复色光以一定的入射角 "},{"type":"math","value":"i (i \\neq 0)"},{"type":"text","value":" 从O点进入棱镜后，不同颜色的光以不同角度折射，只有折射后垂直入射到反射膜的光才能原路返回形成激光输出。某一含红、绿、蓝光的复色光入射到三棱镜时，激光器输出的是绿光，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"image