type":"text","value":" 之后其位移大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"5\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 保持不变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 1.4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质点在 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时向 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向振动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 0.3\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质点在 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 1.6s"},{"type":"text","value":" 时向 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴负方向振动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 在 "},{"type":"math","value":"0\\sim2025\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 内 "},{"type":"math","value":"x=0.8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质点运动的路程比 "},{"type":"math","value":"x=0.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的质点多 "},{"type":"math","value":"6\\mathrm{cm}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","光学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8d0e2651ed3a4aa6d7c9a677b3641d88556d363edde22b95e009bdfb314c9b38","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（I、II、III共3题，共14分）\n14-I．（6分）如图甲所示是某实验小组“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”的实验装置。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6d5823aaf5ddaa660d3bfc326c41f44ded4c48e5e750acdd0497ba81fea0eb6d.png","width":445,"height":276,"width_mm":52.141,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/627d107baececb3274f87a1db5dfb64a29c9bb16bebd9e27e6bc526bd9757a7e.png","width":605,"height":294,"width_mm":71.014,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（1）在通过调整长木板的倾角来补偿阻力时，正确的操作是（填空）。\nA. 小车后面安装纸带，前面挂重物\nB. 小车后面安装纸带，前面不挂重物\nC. 小车后面不安装纸带，前面挂重物\nD. 小车后面不安装纸带，前面不挂重物\n（2）另一实验小组用如图乙所示的气垫导轨装置进行探究加速度与力的关系实验，设计了如下的实验步骤：\nA. 将气垫导轨调整成水平；\nB. 在导轨上选择两个适当的位置安装光电门 1、2，并连接数字毫秒器；通过导轨上的标尺测出两光电门间的距离 l；测出滑块上遮光条的宽度 d；\nC. 用天平测量滑块和遮光条的总质量 M；读出槽码总质量 m；\nD. 将滑块从光电门右侧静止释放，从数字计时器上读出遮光条通过光电门 1、2 的时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\nE. 保持遮光条和滑块总质量不变，增加槽码直至槽码质量与滑块和遮光条总质量接近相等，重复实验，将数据记录表格，得出各次滑块加速度；\n①错误的实验步骤是（填空）（用字母表示）\n②若气垫导轨未调成水平，且左端略高，则可能得到的图像是（填空）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a2bdb1254895d460f6daf4676aee8e738a6d1728dd3a0d42a7f247ba3052f7c1.png","width":239,"height":189,"width_mm":27.965,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0a8ffa481ff3f02b859ed11d13a9bff365a87ef06cbeb8e048c0423d0aa3a56d.png","width":237,"height":191,"width_mm":27.768,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/94392e807628f6412c7a31fb7391ab6e73d714d1742726aaef5efc3418705b9a.png","width":239,"height":189,"width_mm":27.965,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC\n14-Ⅱ．在“用双缝干涉测量光的波长”实验中，\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/51db91db620a02776cc953b7825e03293d50497e7e594f83da81b16a2ba330d5.png","width":795,"height":254,"width_mm":93.347,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-Ⅱ 题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/94512c82944846f9ab55dadebcc2abc040079ea78dc692a77fafa6ae782f1d58.png","width":608,"height":292,"width_mm":71.29,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-Ⅱ题图乙\n（1）如图甲双缝安装在图甲中（填空）位置（选填“A”、“B”、“C”、“D”或“E”）\n（2）某次测量条纹间距的时候，由于游标卡尺0刻度处标记不清，目镜测量头处显示如图乙所示，箭头为游标卡尺与主尺对齐处，则读数为（填空）mm。\n(3) 如图甲所示, 某同学测得图中装置中 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间的距离分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 又测得第 1 条亮条纹中心到第 6 条亮条纹中心的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":" , 已知单缝宽度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 双缝间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 则该单色光波长的表达式为 （填空）。\n14-III. （1）某同学用多用电表的欧姆挡来测量双量程电压表 "},{"type":"math","value":"3\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" 挡的内阻，如图甲所示。\n①先将选择开关旋至欧姆挡倍率“×100”挡，正确欧姆调零后进行测量，则黑表笔应接电压表的（填空）（填“—”或“3”）接线柱。\n②若用多用电表欧姆挡的同一挡位来正确测量该电压表 15 V 挡的电阻时，与测 3V 挡的电阻时相比，测 15 V 挡时欧姆表指针偏角 （填空）（填“变小”、“变大”或“不变”），电压表指针偏角（填空）\n(填“变小”、“变大”或“不变”)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ef695de7ba35d3fa9499fbb40916019af9ee7ec1bd4a9453016801fef6cb611a.png","width":797,"height":505,"width_mm":93.544,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-Ⅲ题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/53d05fc0d94d6960d2fb3429f709cc43148b70bf4299165fc15ae2467bdfd339.png","width":386,"height":447,"width_mm":45.295,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-Ⅲ题图乙\n（2）用伏安法测电阻时，由于电压表、电流表内阻的影响，测量结果总存在系统误差。按如图乙所示的电路进行测量，可以消除这种系统误差。\n该实验的第一步是：闭合电键 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，将电键 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 接1，调节滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{p}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{p}^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，使两电表指针指示在合适位置，记录此时两电表读数 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ；\n第二步是：保持 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{p}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的滑片位置不动，适当调节另一滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{p}^{'}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，使两电表指针指示在合适位置，将电键 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 接2，记录此时两电表的读数 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。由以上记录数据计算被测电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的表达式是 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{x}="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-I.（1）B （1分）\n(2) ①E （2分）\n②B （2分）\n14-II. (1) C (1 分)\n(2) 10.70 (1 分)\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{d_{2}\\Delta x}{5L_{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n14-III.（1）①3（1分）\n②变小、变小（每空各1分）\n（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{U_1}{I_1} -\\frac{U_2}{I_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1aa5ee0c8e95e27b044b8b2b22f84e76b03b32dbe949019f473480aaf5ae5db8","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. （8分）如图所示是某款气压式升降椅及其气缸柱放大结构图，圆柱形气缸固定于底座，内部充有一定量的气体（可视为理想气体），气缸内部横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=20cm^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。活塞上端被气缸上端卡环卡住，此刻气缸内部气体柱长L=30cm，外部大气压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}=1\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":" ，气缸内部气体压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=4p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，活塞、连接杆、凳子面总质量为m=5kg， "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不计任何摩擦。\n（1）若椅子上放了一个快递，椅子下降，一段时间后气缸内气体温度不变，此过程中，活塞对气体做功20J，判断整个过程中缸内气体是（填空）（填“吸热”或“放热”），相应的热量为（填空）J；（2）若椅子上不放任何东西，求活塞对卡环的作用力；\n(3) 某同学坐在椅子 (脚始终悬空) 上后, 经过足够长时间, 椅子高度下降 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta h = 5 \\mathrm{~cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 后平衡, 求该同学的质量。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e7bf318799433556df237cdc1082a4c50657948c0059a87d75d3369ef139efa1.png","width":460,"height":270,"width_mm":53.96,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.【解析】（1）放热 20J....（每个答案各1分）\n（2）活塞静止不动处于平衡状态"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1S + mg + F = p_2S"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）求得："},{"type":"math","value":"F = 550\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）根据牛顿第三定律得到"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{卡}} = F = 550\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"，活塞对卡环的力方向竖直向上。……（1分）\n（3）根据玻意耳定律，有："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}V_{1}=p_{3}V_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{3}=4.8\\times10^{5}Pa"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（2分）\n活塞静止不动处于平衡状态"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}S+mg+Mg=p_{3}S"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得M=71kg。……（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7e83e5a4c36b97110f5ea35b8d13b5bd539cff15873333e6667f7dc2078ef50f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）某游戏装置的竖直截面如图所示，装置由足够长的光滑水平轨道 BC，圆心角均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、半径 R=1m 的圆弧轨道 CD、EF，长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 可调节）以 v=8m/s 的速率逆时针方向转动的传送带 DE，以及长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的水平平台 FG 组成，平台右侧为竖直挡板，物块与竖直挡板的碰撞为弹性碰撞。圆弧轨道 CD、EF 与传送带 DE 分别相切于 D、E 两点，圆弧轨道 EF 与平台 FG 可随 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 长度的变化而调整相应位置。一质量 m=0.3kg 的物块 a 与轻质弹簧接触但不连接，静止于水平面上。现一质量与物块 a 相同的物块 b 用一长度为 l=2m 的轻绳悬挂于 P 点，从与竖直方向成 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha=60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的 A 位置以垂直轻绳方向的初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" 开始运动，当其运动至 P 点正下方 B 处时（物块 b 恰好不与地面接触），轻绳与 P 点正下方 h=1.6m 处的一钉子作用而断裂，物块 b 继续向右运动压缩弹簧。当物块 a 与弹簧分离后立即撤去弹簧，物块 a 滑上圆弧轨道 CD。已知物块 a 与传送带 DE 及平台 FG 间的动摩擦因数均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其他摩擦和阻力均不计，各物块均可视为质点，弹簧处于弹性范围内， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^{\\circ}=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos37^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" ，重力加速度大小 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。求：\n（1）轻绳即将断裂时的张力大小；\n（2）弹簧被压缩过程中的最大弹性势能；\n（3）若物块 a 在运动过程中不脱离轨道，且不再与物块 b 碰撞，求传送带的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的取值范围。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5e51c84c4cef6088531cdca7d35f12099151869b88cf09c461a5155007b084cd.png","width":1237,"height":443,"width_mm":145.338,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q16-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. 【解析】解答．(1)设物块 b 摆至最低点的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，根据动能定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"mgl(1-\\cos\\alpha)=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1 分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=6m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n对 b 受力分析有"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{T}}-mg=m\\frac{v_1^2}{l-h}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{T}}=30\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":"共速时弹簧的弹性势能最大，由动量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{1} = 2mv"},{"type":"text","value":"，则："},{"type":"math","value":"v = 3\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）由能量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{Pm} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_1^2 - \\frac{1}{2} 2mv^2 = 2.7J"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n(3)物块 a、b 分离时，速度交换，则："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n① 物块 a 恰好能不脱离 EF，则在 E 点"},{"type":"math","value":"mg \\cos \\theta = mv_{E}^{2}/R"},{"type":"text","value":"，则："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{E} = 2\\sqrt{2}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"-mgR(1-\\cos\\theta)-mg\\sin\\theta\\cdot L_{E}-\\mu mg\\cos\\theta\\cdot L_{E}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则："},{"type":"math","value":"L_E=1.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"……"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n此时物块 a 恰好能不脱离 EF 时能滑上 FG 平台，且停在平台上，则在平台上滑行的路程为 x"},{"type":"math","value":"-mgR(1-\\cos\\theta)-\\mu mgx=0-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{E}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则："},{"type":"math","value":"x=0.4\\mathrm{m}=2L_2"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"恰好与竖直挡板碰撞后停在 F 点，因此能滑上平台 FG 的情况都不会从 EF 返回\n②物块 a 恰好能首次运动至 F 点停在平台上，由物块 a 从 C 运动至 F 点的动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"-2mgR(1-\\cos\\theta)-mg\\sin\\theta\\cdot L_{F}-\\mu mg\\cos\\theta\\cdot L_{F}=0-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则："},{"type":"math","value":"L_F=1.4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"综述得："},{"type":"math","value":"1.2\\mathrm{m}\\leq L_1\\leq1.4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6bda006d98ad1373ff88f879ef6160e8bea594435f5c54de4131171dfa3a451c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （12分）为研究强磁体的磁性，某小组进行了以下实验：如图甲所示，建立沿水平方向的坐标轴 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" ，将一圆柱形钕铁硼强磁体 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 对称的置于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴，磁体中心位于坐标原点 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 。将一圆形线圈 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 置于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴负方向较远处，线圈轴线与 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴重合，线圈与两个传感器（图中未画出）相接。现通过外力作用使线圈沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向做匀速直线运动，这时，一个传感器测得通过圆形线圈 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 的磁通量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi"},{"type":"text","value":" （数字“5”与“10”仅表示格数）随圆环位置 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 的变化图像如图乙所示，另一个传感器测得线圈中的电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 随时间 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 变化的图像如图丙所示。已知在乙图中 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = \\pm 6\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的切线斜率绝对值最大，丙图中时刻6s到10s之间的图线可近似的看成直线，线圈的匝数 "},{"type":"math","value":"n = 100"},{"type":"text","value":" ，线圈的电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 10\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 。为研究方便，不考虑传感器与线圈间力的作用，线圈导线各处的磁感应强度大小均视为相同。求：\n（1）圆形线圈做匀速直线运动的速度大小；\n(2) 6s 至 8s 期间流过线圈的电量;\n（3）整个过程中通过线圈的最大磁通量；\n（4）为维持线圈匀速移动，所需水平方向外力的最大值。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/438c08c40a703d500102a36d4106a662a2b776d23268cd7816871fb713c6ac54.png","width":350,"height":210,"width_mm":40.962,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7bd1c991b4a21d975ced0067f3ed150aed17b7824302ae38776d5eeed06f3d80.png","width":415,"height":277,"width_mm":53.513,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/371ea65f44473b9f8969516b98c3111621b383d971a6359eea17dac6d6e500bb.png","width":383,"height":257,"width_mm":49.391,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. 【解析】（1）根据乙图中"},{"type":"math","value":"x=+6cm"},{"type":"text","value":"处的切线斜率最大，即感应电动势最大，对应于丙图中时刻 t=10s，而乙图中 x=0 处则对应于丙图中时刻 t=8s，故圆形线圈做匀速直线运动的速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{\\Delta x}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{6\\times10^{-2}}{2}\\mathrm{m/s}=0.03\\mathrm{m/s};\\quad(3\\text{ 分})"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）6s 至 8s 期间流过电阻 R 的电流均匀变化，则流过电阻 R 的电量"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\overline{I}t=\\frac{I_{\\mathrm{m}}+0}{2}t=\\frac{20\\times10^{-3}+0}{2}\\times2\\mathrm{C}=2\\times10^{-2}\\mathrm{C};\\quad(3\\text{ 分})"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）由法拉第电磁感应定律可得"},{"type":"math","value":"q=\\overline{I}t=\\frac{\\overline{E}}{R}t=n\\frac{\\Delta\\Phi}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n根据乙图可得，6s 至 8s 期间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta\\Phi=\\Phi_{m}-\\frac{7}{10}\\Phi_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（1分）\n综合得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi_{m}=\\frac{1}{150}Wb"},{"type":"text","value":"; ……（1分）\n（4）为维持线圈匀速移动，应有"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{外}}=F_{\\text{安}}"},{"type":"text","value":"最大"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}m}=nB_{r}I_{m}\\cdot2\\pi r"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（1分）\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"为线圈所在处径向的磁感应强度，r 为线圈半径，\n又"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{m}=\\frac{E_{m}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{m}=nB_{r}\\cdot2\\pi rv"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（1分）\n综合得"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}m}=\\frac{I_{m}^{2}R}{v}=\\frac{2}{15}N"},{"type":"text","value":"即所需水平方向上的最大外力为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{2}{15}N"},{"type":"text","value":"。……（1分）\n说明：直接根据能量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"Fv=I_{m}^{2}R"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{2}{15}N"},{"type":"text","value":"，给满分。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--tianyu-xiezuoti-2510","source_question_id":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6b1638868fe0c994a8da08d7dbd13c3a46c851930c5c64822a988055cb0af6fc","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13 分）如图所示为某研究光电效应的装置示意图。足够大的金属板 M 和金属筛网 N 竖直正对放置，金属筛网 N 接地，且只能让速度方向垂直其平面的粒子通过。筛网右侧分布有区域足够大，方向平行于金属板水平向里、磁感应强度大小为 B 的匀强磁场。沿磁场方向放置一半径为 R 的足够长金属圆筒 Q，其轴线 O 与筛网 N 的距离为 3R，圆筒通过导线和内阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的电流表A 接地，其最右侧壁记为 a 点。现用频率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光照射板 M 右表面时，发现在金属圆筒最初不带电时，电子只能射到圆筒上以 a 点和 c 点为界的 abc 弧上，而 adc 弧上各点均不能接收到电子。已知电子质量为 m，电荷量为 e，普朗克恒量为 h，忽略运动电子间的相互作用。\n（1）求逸出光电子的最大初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（2）若逐渐降低入射光的频率，发现某时刻电流表A 的示数恰好为零，求此时入射光的频率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）今在金属板 M 和筛网 N 间加一电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U(\\varphi_{M}<\\varphi_{N}=0)"},{"type":"text","value":" ，且 eU 远大于光电子的最大初动能。仍以频率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 入射光照射板 M 右表面，当金属圆筒 Q 上电荷量达到相对稳定后，测得电流表A 的示数为 I。求电流恒定时：\n①电子到达圆筒 Q 时速度 v;\n②圆筒 Q 的发热功率 P。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7adfeb95b18b5b79428e0897d2c910c72c19c6a24c0eb208660a5e1aa248aec8.png","width":567,"height":423,"width_mm":66.534,"row_group":"tianyu-xiezuoti-2510-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. 【解析】（1）根据题意，逸出初速度最大的光电子在磁场中运动的轨道半径"},{"type":"math","value":"r = 4R"},{"type":"text","value":"，…（1分）由"},{"type":"math","value":"Bev_0=\\frac{mv_0^2}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = \\frac{4eBR}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"。……（2分）\n（2）用频率"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_1"},{"type":"text","value":"的光照射金属板 M 时，根据爱因斯坦光电效应方程得"},{"type":"math","value":"h\\nu_1=\\frac{1}{2}mv_0^2+W_0"},{"type":"text","value":"，……"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n入射光的频率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_2"},{"type":"text","value":"时，所有电子恰好不能打在圆筒 Q，可知"},{"type":"math","value":"r'=2R"},{"type":"text","value":"，设此时逸出光电子的最大初速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v'"},{"type":"text","value":"，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"ev'B=m\\frac{v'^{2}}{r'}\\cdots\\cdots"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n又由爱因斯坦光电效应方程得"},{"type":"math","value":"h\\nu_2=\\frac{1}{2}m{v'}^2+W_0"},{"type":"text","value":"，联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\nu_2=\\nu_1-\\frac{6e^2B^2R^2}{hm}"},{"type":"text","value":"；……（1分）\n（3）稳定时，圆柱体上电荷不再增加，电流表A"},{"type":"text","value":"两端电压为"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{A}=Ir_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，且"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi_{Q}<0"},{"type":"text","value":"；……（1分）\n由于 eU 远大于光电子的最大初动能，故可忽略光电子逸出的初速度，则射到圆柱表面时速度 v 满足"},{"type":"math","value":"e(U-U_A)=\\frac{1}{2}mv^2-0"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\sqrt{\\frac{2e(U-Ir_{0})}{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"；……（1分）\n（4）设时间 t 内到达金属圆筒 Q 的电子数为 N，则有"},{"type":"math","value":"N=\\frac{It}{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（1 分）\n则时间 t 内圆筒接收到粒子的总能量为 E=NeU，……（1 分）\n消耗在电阻上的功率，根据能量守恒，圆筒发热功率 P 满足"},{"type":"math","value":"E=P_{r}t+Pt"},{"type":"text","value":"，……（1 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"P=UI-I^{2}r_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"。……（1 分）\n（说明：直接根据能量守恒给出该式，同样给分）"}]}}]}
